  "description": "Server-side library that hosts the spark.signer.v1alpha1 RemoteSigner.Connect bidi gRPC endpoint and\n      exposes an IRemoteSparkSignerProvider that nspark code can use to get an NSpark.Signer.ISparkSigner\n      backed by a connected remote signer (Swift, Kotlin, etc.). Includes pluggable authentication and\n      wallet-ownership extension points, identity_proof handshake verification, and per-connection\n      registry with configurable eviction.",
